    sources: ['Surah al-Anbiya (21:83-86)', 'Surah Sad (38:41-44)', 'Qisas al-Anbiya by Ibn Kathir', 'Tafsir Ibn Kathir on Surah al-Anbiya and Surah Sad', 'Al-Bidayah wan-Nihayah by Ibn Kathir'],
